<!-- A photo well: a frame on the second surface that clips its photo. cls sets the ratio and the radius (aspect-photo rounded-card, 3:2, by default); sizes is the image's sizes; eager loads it at once (the hero's, the first screen). Without a photo it keeps its shape, quiet, and shows the initial of name when one is given (a person). The photo carries its own alt. -->
<span class="grid place-items-center overflow-hidden bg-scheme-surface-2 text-scheme-muted { cls ?? 'aspect-photo rounded-card' }">{#if asset}{ image_tag(asset, { sizes: sizes, class: 'size-full object-cover', loading: eager ? 'eager' : 'lazy' }) }{:else if name}<span class="font-heading text-h2" aria-hidden="true">{ name | slice(0, 1) }</span>{/if}</span>
